{"node_id":"LVMC_11_52_130_A2","law_refs":["LVMC-11-52-130-A2"],"subject":{"binder":"subject","class_elements":["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle"]},"segmentation":[{"id":"p1","text":"No person shall stop, stand or park a vehicle","role":"obligation"},{"id":"p2","text":"except when necessary to avoid conflict","role":"standard"},{"id":"p3","text":"with other traffic","role":"exception"},{"id":"p4","text":"in compliance with law","role":"exception"},{"id":"p5","text":"or the directions of a police officer","role":"exception"},{"id":"p6","text":"or a traffic control device,","role":"exception"},{"id":"p7","text":"in any of the following places:","role":"boilerplate"},{"id":"q1","text":"At any place or in any space adjacent to a curb","role":"condition"},{"id":"q2","text":"which has been designated and posted as a fire lane","role":"condition"},{"id":"q3","text":"pursuant to the City's Fire Code,","role":"reference"},{"id":"q4","text":"whether the vehicle is attended or unattended","role":"condition"},{"id":"q5","text":"and whether the location is on public or private property.","role":"condition"}],"elements":[{"span":"p1","atoms":["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle"],"derived":["drv.motion.complete_halt"],"justification":"\"stop\" here is prohibited, so DEF-NRS-484A-260 applies by its own scope (\"when prohibited, any halting, even momentarily, of a vehicle, whether occupied or not\"); standing and parking are halts too, so the three together are any halt: drv.motion.complete_halt (\"The road user is at rest at the observation\"), a state at one observation, not an act over time. \"a vehicle\" is the admitted aggregate DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle, claimed whole. \"No person\" is read through the vehicle's controlled motion."},{"span":"p3","atoms":["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-285::traffic","rel.ahead_behind_in_lane","rel.surface_gap"],"derived":[],"justification":"\"other traffic\" is the admitted aggregate DEF-NRS-484A-285::traffic (\"pedestrians, ridden or h